📊 Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard

An interactive Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard built using Microsoft Power BI to analyze sales performance, revenue trends, profitability, product performance, regional sales, and payment methods.

📌 Project Overview

This project transforms sales data into an interactive business intelligence dashboard. It provides a quick overview of important KPIs and helps identify sales trends, top-performing products, categories, and regions.

The dashboard includes interactive Order Date, Region, Category, and Product slicers for dynamic analysis.

🎯 Objectives

Analyze overall sales and revenue performance

Track total profit, orders, and quantity

Identify monthly sales trends

Find the top-performing products by sales

Compare sales across different categories

Analyze regional sales performance

Understand sales distribution by payment mode

Provide interactive filtering for business analysis

