🖥️ Dashboard Preview



💡 Key Insights

Electronics is the dominant sales category.

Laptop is the top-performing product by sales.

North has the highest regional sales among the displayed regions.

UPI represents the largest share of sales by payment mode.

Monthly sales fluctuate throughout the year, with October showing one of the strongest monthly performances.

🚀 How to Use

Download or clone this repository.

Open Sales_Revenue_Analysis_Dashboard.pbix using Microsoft Power BI Desktop.

If required, update the dataset source path.

Refresh the data.

Use the slicers to explore the dashboard interactively.

